OL,3,GNEWSACouncil defends progress on
OL,4,Avandal-hit playground
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnchorsholme councillors Paul Galley
OL,7,Fand Anita Cooper, along with Norbreck
OL,8,Fcouncillor Julie Sloman, said the
OL,9,Fcouncil was dragging its feet over
OL,10,Fstarting work. However, Labour-led
OL,11,FBlackpool Council said it was always
OL,12,Fset to be finished in March.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
